-- independently_validated passages (once migration 160 is applied),
-- still 1-3 short of Decision 227's own MINIMUM foundation target (4-6),
-- with QT-RC-07 (Multi-Entity Comparative Attribute Extraction) as the
-- single named, disclosed zero-coverage gap across the entire estate.
